    {
      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_654",
      "message_ID": 654,
      "speaker": "Shopkeeper",
      "context": "One alternative from the original Square shopkeeper trend conversation. The local trend state and random branch select the response.",
      "source_meaning": "If the sailor has brought the named product as stock, the shopkeeper asks them to sell it soon at the Market.",
      "localization_note": "The quick question introduces the condition. The advice keeps the urgency and destination without implying a sale has happened. Stock works for both plural and mass goods.",
